WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.060
<b>Inter-High Road Race</b>

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.700
<i>150 meters to go!</i>

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.690
<i>All that's left is to pedal as hard as I can!</i>

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:14.890
Sohoku's Imaizumi is so fast!

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:15.790
Wow!

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:18.080
Sohoku's victory is certain!

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:22.000
<i>What? Certain?</i>

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>What? These blind fans don't see anything.</i>

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:29.840
<i>They assume their shallow predictions</i>

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:35.210
<i>are universal laws and shout about them.</i>

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.510
<i>Stupid.</i>

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:41.320
<i>Morph!</i>

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:42.810
<i>There's no such thing...</i>

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:44.060
<i>Morph!</i>

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.770
<i>...as certain!</i>

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.360
<i>Morph!</i>

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>The truth can only be known by those 
who give their all, eliminate excess,</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:59.330
<i>crystallize their victory, and move 
forward on their own two legs!</i>

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:03.560
<i>Midousuji's Flying Ride!</i>

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:05.240
<i>Ashikiba-san mentioned this.</i>

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:07.660
<i>No...</i>

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:10.030
<i>He's stretching his neck out even farther?</i>

00:01:10.030 --> 00:01:13.010
<i>Is this an evolved version?</i>

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:15.970
Morphokyaaa!

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:23.970
Phokya!

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:36.450
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.510
Phokya!

00:02:55.590 --> 00:03:00.090
<i>LINE.22  Three Powerhouses</i>

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:58.570
<i>Pests! Pests in front of me!</i>

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:02.200
<i>Pests are always prey!</i>

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.310
<i>I will prey upon them!</i>

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:09.620
<i>What is that?</i>

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:13.130
<i>What is that lump of muscle on his back?</i>

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:15.320
<i>It's growing.</i>

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.670
<i>It must be an evolution of the Flying Ride!</i>

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:22.680
Yeah!

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:22.680
<i>This can't be good!</i>

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.220
Kyoto Fushimi's closing! Wow!

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:26.100
Gross!

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:28.440
He's shaking his butt.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:30.560
What does "phokya" mean?

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.480
<i>Overthrow, overthrow, overthrow, overthrow!</i>

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.440
<i>Overthrow!</i>

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:40.320
<i>Expectations, imagination, hopes, 
cheers, assumptions, common sense...</i>

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:43.360
<i>I'll overthrow them all...</i>

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:46.370
<i>By winning this race!</i>

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:48.260
<i>I am...</i>

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:50.330
<i>The man who always wins!</i>

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.330
<i>Midousuji Akira-kun!</i>

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.240
There's 100 meters left!

00:03:57.240 --> 00:04:00.260
<i>That's plenty of distance to catch up!</i>

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.830
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:08.500
<i>In that past I said that and squeezed</i>

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:13.230
<i>my crystallized victory
 too tightly, making me drop it.</i>

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.880
<i>I'll be fine this year.</i>

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:20.530
<i>I'll hold my victory with both hands,</i>

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.950
<i>so it can't escape.</i>

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:35.240
Akira-kun, watch your step over there.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:37.420
There are so many, Mom.

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:39.410
You're right.

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:41.670
It's dark out. Watch your step.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.010
The fireflies are beautiful.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.160
<i>They're so beautiful.</i>

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:51.910
<i>I'm sure mom would love it 
if I brought her some.</i>

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:04.040
Are you trying to catch them, Akira-kun?

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:06.260
You can do it, Akira!

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:13.290
You're so clumsy, Akira-kun.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:14.750
Are you okay?

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:18.920
I caught one.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:21.040
It's glowing!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.920
Let me see!

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:24.530
No!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:29.830
I'm taking this to my mom at the hospital.

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:33.050
I know she'll like it.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.390
I caught it. I won't let it get away.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:39.610
But fireflies don't live long.

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:42.020
Not long enough to take to the hospital.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.430
Let it go.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:44.650
No.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:49.280
Akira-kun, if you squeeze that tight...

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:00.710
There were so many.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:01.920
They were all around the river.

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:06.300
They'd light up like "fwoom" and go out.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:10.350
I caught one so I could show you.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:11.350
Like this.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:16.100
But, uh...

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.210
I held it too tight...

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.250
and crushed it.

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:34.240
Akira, you're so good at explaining things.

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:42.420
You're so good, I feel like I was there.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:47.780
You even include gestures and sounds.

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:52.510
It's too bad about the firefly, 
but I felt like I could see it.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:56.270
Thanks to you, I got to see the fireflies.

00:06:57.590 --> 00:06:59.320
<i>Thanks to me...</i>

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:03.690
No, real fireflies are prettier.

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:05.690
I'll take you there.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:09.190
I'll bring a flashlight and show you the way.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.320
It's dangerous, so I'll lead you by the hand.

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:16.290
Since firefly season's over 
this year, we'll go next year.

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:20.590
You're right.

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:25.400
Thank you, Akira. I look forward to it.

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:30.300
<i>I remember that summer clearly.</i>

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.180
<i>The smell of disinfectant.</i>

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.670
<i>The slightly chilly building.</i>

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:39.560
<i>The hospital was my oasis.</i>

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:44.230
<i>Happy times and warm, fuzzy feelings.</i>

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:47.410
<i>If I were to compare it 
to a color, it would be...</i>

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:50.340
<i>Yellow.</i>

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:57.030
There's a proper way to catch fireflies.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:58.330
It's like this...

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.170
Midousuji-san!

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:14.650
I'm okay now. Thank you.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:20.790
Akira-kun's been coming every day
 since summer break started.

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:23.380
He bikes in from far away, right?

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:26.860
He said he's been practicing a lot.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.320
You must be proud of him.

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:33.400
He's always been a hard worker.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:38.440
He can be awkward, but he's honest.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:44.040
I wish I could've been with him.

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:51.160
I think he's been pushing himself 
too hard without me around.

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:54.100
He's too proud to give up.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:59.760
He stopped bringing me notices 
for class observation day.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:06.130
Let's talk to the doctor about you 
temporarily leaving the hospital.

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:08.230
We can ask Akira-kun for his schedule.

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:11.400
You're right.

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:16.630
I think he wants to show me
 how hard he works.

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:19.660
How he grits his teeth.

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:29.150
Sometimes I imagine him entering 
middle school, then high school.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:35.660
He'll ride that cool bike and keep 
moving forward with all his strength.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:40.600
Charging straight ahead at incredible speeds.

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:45.350
If I could see him pass everyone 
else and take first...

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:52.160
I probably wouldn't be able to stop crying.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:55.680
You must be looking forward to it.

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:58.950
You'd better get well soon, so you can see it.

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:04.700
You're right. I'll do my best.

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:06.960
It's okay.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:11.500
Just imagining how Akira-kun's will grow...

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:14.200
gives me strength.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:37.030
He's back. The boy from room 302.

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:38.860
Oh, her son?

00:10:39.810 --> 00:10:43.000
But she's not here anymore.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:51.120
<i>I promised I'd show her 
the fireflies next year.</i>

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:54.590
<i>She said she'd come watch me race.</i>

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:58.090
<i>Why isn't she at the window?</i>

00:10:58.690 --> 00:11:00.880
<i>I'm here, so why isn't 
she coming to greet me?</i>

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.600
<i>Is she not here today?</i>

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:08.850
<i>Whatever...</i>

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:15.690
<i>Why? Why don't I feel good, even though 
I'm coming back from the hospital?</i>

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:20.070
<i>Why don't I feel warm and fuzzy inside?</i>

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:22.130
<i>I don't get it.</i>

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:23.870
<i>But...</i>

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:28.330
No matter what happens, keep moving forward.

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:33.130
My little boy won.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:39.460
<i>I'll keep moving forward, 
no matter what happens.</i>

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:43.930
There's a proper way to catch fireflies.

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.320
It's like this.

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:49.000
You do it gently, so you don't crush them.

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:51.520
That's how everything works.

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:55.750
Anything important you've got to grab gently.

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:00.590
Kyoto Fushimi's catching up!

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:01.780
He's so determined!

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.610
What's with his form?!

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:07.790
<i>Ball of victory... Rolling ball...</i>

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:10.120
<i>This time, I won't let you go.</i>

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.590
<i>I'd forgotten.</i>

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:15.400
<i>Grab it with both hands.</i>

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:19.220
<i>Grasp it tightly, but gently, 
so it doesn't break.</i>

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:23.010
<i>After all, it's important.</i>

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:28.010
<i>I'm riding for victory!</i>

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:31.520
Kyoto Fushimi caught up to Sohoku!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:32.870
<i>They're neck and neck.</i>

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.350
<i>There's less than 100 meters left.</i>

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:38.230
<i>So what's going on?</i>

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:39.930
<i>I'm in a dangerous situation.</i>

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:42.700
<i>Ashikiba-san made me the ace.</i>

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.700
<i>The finish line's right there.</i>

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:50.950
<i>Even though I'm a climber, my body's 
tingling and my heart's pounding.</i>

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:54.950
<i>I'm so excited by this situation.</i>

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:57.290
<i>This feeling...</i>

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:01.800
<i>My brother was a great sprinter.</i>

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:06.740
<i>My brother started riding early 
and quickly distinguished himself.</i>

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:09.180
<i>Before I knew it...</i>

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:14.720
<i>Shinkai Hayato wins the 
elementary school division again!</i>

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:17.960
<i>He was always shining up 
on the winner's podium.</i>

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:23.900
<i>It wasn't long before I started riding, too.</i>

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:25.720
Faster!

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:27.280
Wait, Hayato!

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:30.730
Yuto, let's race to the top of Mount Azuma!

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:31.330
Okay!

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:33.650
Yeah!

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.330
<i>Everything was so much fun.</i>

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:39.840
<i>I loved being praised by 
my brother, so I rode every day.</i>

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:42.260
Want some?

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:43.550
Yeah!

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.650
The energy bars you give me 
taste so good for some reason.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:50.850
They all taste the same.

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:55.970
Hey, how can I ride like you?

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.240
It comes down to how much 
you practice, I guess.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:00.520
Got it!

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:03.590
Since you're three years younger,

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:12.400
What? By the time I enter school, 
you'll have graduated...

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:13.410
Huh?

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.000
No!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.670
"No" isn't going to change anything.

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:18.390
I want to ride together!

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:24.450
<i>Since I was so persistent,
he talked to a teacher about it.</i>

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:27.630
<i>I was allowed to practice with him 
as long as it was only on Sundays.</i>

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:30.480
<i>As a grade schooler,</i>

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:34.890
<i>I was allowed to ride with my brother's 
Hadano Daiichi Middle School team.</i>

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:37.640
This is Yuto. He's my younger brother.

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:40.100
He started biking recently.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:42.210
He's got talent.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:46.190
<i>Talent? What's talent?</i>

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:48.310
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:51.850
<i>Now I get to keep riding with Hayato.</i>

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:57.160
<i>At the time, I was really excited.</i>

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.170
<i>I wanted to see how incredible Hayato 
had become as a middle schooler.</i>

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:06.050
<i>As though anticipating the 
performance of a star player on TV,</i>

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:13.350
<i>some nights I couldn't sleep because 
I was so excited to see him up close.</i>

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:17.310
<i>Why am I recalling that now?</i>

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:19.270
<i>I'm in the middle of a race!</i>

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.810
Yeah!

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:27.410
<i>But my brother left me behind far 
more quickly than I imagined.</i>

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:32.530
<i>What? We're riding in a huge group?</i>

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.530
<i>The guys in front are in my way.</i>

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:36.790
<i>I can't ride with Hayato like this.</i>

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.410
Excuse me!

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:43.770
Since you're still small, you can 
stay out of the wind behind us.

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:44.630
There's no need to be shy.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.810
That's not it.

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:49.110
There's no point if I'm back here. Hayato—

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:50.990
Your brother's amazing.

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:54.510
As a first-year, he took third 
in his first tournament.

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:56.740
Can I move up to the front?

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:58.970
To the front? Don't waste your time.

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:02.440
Shinkai's so incredible, he's on
 a different training menu.

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:04.590
<i>What? No way!</i>

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:05.190
<i>Wait!</i>

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:06.940
I'm going with him!

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:09.450
You can't. The course is too hard.

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:11.560
Then when can I ride with him?

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:15.400
He's faster than bad high schoolers.

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:17.120
You can't handle it.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:25.670
<i>Everyone else always happily described 
how much better my brother was than me.</i>

00:16:26.490 --> 00:16:28.240
<i>We're on different levels?</i>

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:29.770
<i>Don't be absurd, damn it!</i>

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:31.800
<i>I'll just raise my own level!</i>

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:36.180
<i>I'll participate in a race and win!</i>

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:39.000
<i>It comes down to how much you practice.</i>

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:41.730
<i>Hayato said not to get the wrong idea.</i>

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:46.730
<i>I started practicing alone 
to catch up to Hayato.</i>

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:48.330
Yeah!

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:50.160
What a fast grade schooler!

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:52.080
<i>I practiced every day.</i>

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:52.990
<i>And then...</i>

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:56.490
<i>I won my eighth race.</i>

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:59.810
<i>Yes! See that, everyone?</i>

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:02.790
<i>You can't have any objections now.</i>

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:06.460
<i>Anyway, winning a race feels good.</i>

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.820
<i>Is this how Hayato felt?</i>

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:10.800
<i>It's not bad.</i>

00:17:11.570 --> 00:17:14.370
<i>Now people will know the name "Yuto."</i>

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:18.220
<i>But what I learned at that race...</i>

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:23.220
<i>The winner of the elementary school division 
is Shinkai Hayato's younger brother!</i>

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.480
<i>...was how great my brother was.</i>

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.110
Wow, he's Hayato's brother.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.070
When his brother was in grade school...

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.200
I know the one. That race, right?

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:34.570
Yeah.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.340
<i>Huh? Hey!</i>

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:37.950
<i>Wait! I'm the one who won!</i>

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.620
<i>I worked pretty hard for this!</i>

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:42.600
<i>I'm Yuto!</i>

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.090
Congratulations.

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:45.120
Can I get an interview?

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.820
Sure.

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:49.770
Your brother's riding in the 
middle school race after this.

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:50.630
Do you think he'll win?

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:51.380
What?

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:54.470
What's your brother normally like?

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:56.030
What? My brother?

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:58.640
He makes me get the remote control for him.

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:01.690
I bet you hope you'll catch up
 to your brother soon.

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:03.700
Y-Yeah...

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:08.730
<i>Why am I smiling and talking about Hayato?</i>

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:14.470
<i>After that day, things between me 
and my brother became awkward.</i>

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:16.530
<i>We stopped talking.</i>

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:19.980
Yeah!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:19.980
Such acceleration!

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:21.950
#16's trying to catch up!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.090
What's wrong, Yuto?

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:28.040
Were you not happy to win the other day?

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:31.720
I was happy.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:33.290
I see.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:40.430
Listen, I'm going to stop riding 
with the middle school team.

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:42.680
I see.

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:46.680
I've only ever been Hayato-kun's 
younger brother.

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:48.690
I see...

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.680
Close the door.

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:52.440
Sure.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:56.440
<i>Hayato-kun, huh?</i>

00:18:57.370 --> 00:19:01.450
<i>Maybe always being seen as my 
brother is stressing him out.</i>

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:05.580
<i>Everyone says it. They all do.</i>

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:09.000
<i>Hayato's amazing,
learn from Hayato, become Hayato.</i>

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:11.090
<i>I can't do it!</i>

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:12.710
<i>Don't be ridiculous!</i>

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.090
<i>I'm Shinkai Yuto!</i>

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:20.880
<i>If I keep riding like this, I'll always
 be Hayato's little brother.</i>

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:24.170
<i>If Hayato-kun's a sprinter...</i>

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:27.190
<i>Then I'll become a climber!</i>

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:30.600
<i>Say it! Say it!</i>

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:33.190
<i>Call me Yuto!</i>

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:35.610
He's so small, but fast!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:37.850
I've seen that face before!

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:39.910
That's Shinkai Hayato's brother!

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:42.380
<i>I'll win the hill climb!</i>

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:44.870
<i>I'll participate in the Inter-High,</i>

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:49.660
<i>beat the strongest climber, and prove
 to everyone that I'm Shinkai Yuto!</i>

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:53.670
<i>I won't follow my brother's path!</i>

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:57.250
<i>It's odd.</i>

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.380
<i>I thought I made up my mind that day.</i>

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:06.290
<i>But since the moment Ashikiba-san made me 
the ace, my cells haven't stopped buzzing.</i>

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:09.940
<i>What's this tightness in my chest?</i>

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:11.390
<i>This nostalgic feeling.</i>

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:16.320
<i>This speed, this excitement, this tension...</i>

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:18.900
<i>I'm just before the finish line on 
the second day of the Inter-High.</i>

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:23.400
<i>It doesn't make sense for me 
to be recalling this now.</i>

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:25.950
Let's race to the top of Mount Azuma!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.410
Okay!

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:30.460
<i>I used to race against Hayato 
all the time for fun.</i>

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:33.120
<i>That was a sprint.</i>

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:36.040
That's it, Yuto! Faster!

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:41.210
<i>With tears in my eyes, a smile on my face...</i>

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:44.100
You're strong.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:46.590
<i>With joy in my heart...</i>

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:50.170
<i>He taught me how to sprint!</i>

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:55.600
There used to be a demon that 
appeared on Hakone's straight roads.

00:20:56.280 --> 00:21:00.610
Have you heard that demon 
has a younger brother?

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:07.910
<i>The brother! His eyes have changed.</i>

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:10.740
<i>A demon! Does he become one, too?</i>

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:13.040
<i>A sprinting demon?</i>

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:16.120
Yeah!

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:20.760
He caught up!

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:22.840
He forced his way in at the last second!

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:24.840
He passed them!

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:26.590
Go, Yuto!

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.590
There's fifty meters left!

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:31.930
<i>A sprint!</i>

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:33.340
<i>It's hard!</i>

00:21:33.340 --> 00:21:35.510
<i>But it feels so good!</i>

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:17.170
Yuto, let's have a staring contest for it.

00:23:17.170 --> 00:23:18.000
Okay.

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:19.960
Ready, set, go!

00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:29.000
Your face is funny!

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:30.440
You lose.

00:23:32.630 --> 00:23:33.390
Want some?

00:23:35.290 --> 00:23:36.390
Yeah!

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:40.020
<i>NEXT LINE  Winner</i>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.020
